# ASD-STE100 style rules for ste-lint.sh — edit freely, no code change needed.
# Format:  severity::perl-regex::advice
#   block = the turn is stopped and must be rewritten
#   warn  = listed as extra advice, only when a block already fired
# Patterns are case-insensitive and matched against PROSE ONLY.
# Code fences, inline code, URLs and file paths are removed before matching.

# ── Non-STE vocabulary: one word, one meaning (STE rule 1.1) ──
block::\butili[sz]e[sd]?\b::use
block::\bleverag(e|es|ed|ing)\b::use
block::\bdelv(e|es|ed|ing)\b::look at
block::\brobust\b::reliable
block::\bseamless(ly)?\b::smooth / smoothly
block::\bcomprehensive(ly)?\b::complete / fully
block::\bholistic(ally)?\b::whole
block::\bnuanced\b::detailed
block::\bunderscor(e|es|ed|ing)\b::show
block::\bshowcas(e|es|ed|ing)\b::show
block::\bmyriad\b::many
block::\bplethora\b::many
block::\bfacilitat(e|es|ed|ing)\b::help
block::\bascertain\b::find out
block::\bendeavou?r\b::try
block::\bcommenc(e|es|ed|ing)\b::start
block::\bprior to\b::before
block::\bsubsequent to\b::after
block::\bin order to\b::to
block::\bdue to the fact that\b::because
block::\bin the event that\b::if
block::\bat this point in time\b::now
block::\bcrucial\b::important
block::\bpivotal\b::important
block::\bparadigm\b::model
block::\brealm\b::area
block::\blandscape\b::area
block::\bunpack(ing)?\b::explain
block::\bspin up\b::start
block::\bcircle back\b::come back to

# ── Jargon and office-speak an 18-year-old should not have to decode ──
block::\bdeep[- ]dive\b::detailed look
block::\blow[- ]hanging fruit\b::easy win
block::\bmove the needle\b::make a difference
block::\bnorth star\b::goal
block::\btable stakes\b::the minimum
block::\ba testament to\b::proof of

# ── Claude-speak: filler that says nothing ──
block::\byou(\047re| are) absolutely right\b::delete it and state the fact
block::\b(great|excellent|good) question\b::delete it and answer
block::\bi(\047d| would) be happy to\b::just do it
block::\blet(\047s| us) dive in\b::delete it
block::\bit(\047s| is) worth noting\b::delete it and state the point
block::\bit(\047s| is) important to note\b::delete it and state the point
block::\bthat said,::but / however
block::\bat the end of the day\b::delete it
block::\brest assured\b::delete it
block::\bthe key takeaway\b::the point is
block::\b(i apologi[sz]e|my apologies)\b::state the correction, do not apologise
block::\bnot just .{1,40}(,|\x{2014}) (it(\047s| is)|but)::say the one thing that is true
block::\bthis (isn(\047)?t|is not) just\b::say what it is
block::\bmore than just\b::say what it is

# ── Vague words that hide the number (advisory) ──
warn::\bvery\b::delete it or give the number
warn::\bquite\b::delete it
warn::\bsomewhat\b::delete it
warn::\bfairly\b::delete it
warn::\brather\b::delete it
warn::\b(essentially|fundamentally|basically)\b::delete it
warn::\barguably\b::say who argues it, or delete
warn::\bsignificantly\b::give the number
